<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>The Learning Studio | Music Sessions in Boronia</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free music resources, public workshops and thoughtful piano guidance from Hanford Lam.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.hanfordlam.com/images/studio-hero.webp">
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/music-studio-app-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Rye&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/home-brief.css?v=7">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/public-nav.css?v=1">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="public-site-header">
    <div class="public-site-header-inner">
      <a class="public-site-brand" href="/"><span class="public-site-brand-kicker">Hanford Lam</span><strong>The Learning Studio · Boronia</strong></a>
      <nav class="public-site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#freeShelf">Free shelf</a><a href="#parkMap">Workshops</a><a href="/reports">Student portal</a><a href="#contactForm">Contact</a></nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <img src="/images/studio-hero.webp" alt="The Learning Studio with two grand pianos" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high">
      <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A small park of music, thought and useful experiments</p><h1>The Learning Studio</h1><p>Enter with something tangled. Leave with greater clarity, something useful, and a reason to return.</p><a class="button" href="#quickDoors">Enter the studio</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="quickDoors">
      <p class="eyebrow">On the studio desk</p><h2>Three places to begin</h2>
      <div class="door-grid">
        <a class="door" href="https://musetrainer.github.io/library/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>♪</b><strong>Train</strong><small>A practical library of famous pieces, made by the MuseTrainer team.</small></a>
        <a class="door" href="https://sightreader.app/#hero-drill" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>♩</b><strong>Sight-read</strong><small>A quick reading drill, made by the Sight Reader team.</small></a>
        <article class="door"><b>?</b><strong>Wander</strong><small id="wikiExtract">Open a strange corner of musical history.</small><div class="wiki-actions"><a id="wikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Random" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Wikipedia</a><button id="wikiNext" type="button">Another</button></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section shelf-section" id="freeShelf">
      <p class="eyebrow">Take-home objects</p><h2>The free shelf</h2><p>Eight short, printable ways into listening, practice and musical thought.</p>
      <div class="shelf">
        <a href="/files/A Ladder of Music Theory A5.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/ALadderOfMusicTheory.png" alt="A Ladder of Music Theory cover"><span>A Ladder of Music Theory</span></a>
        <a href="/files/Build The Arch Ring.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Build the Arch Ring cover.jpg" alt="Build the Arch Ring cover"><span>Build the Arch Ring</span></a>
        <a href="/files/Keystone Texts 2026.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/2026textpage1.jpg" alt="Keystone Texts 2026 cover"><span>Keystone Texts 2026</span></a>
        <a href="/files/antigravityposter.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/antigravityposter.png" alt="Antigravity poster cover"><span>Antigravity</span></a>
        <a href="/files/Piano Performance Development Rubric.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Piano Performance Development Rubric.png" alt="Performance rubric cover"><span>Performance Rubric</span></a>
        <a href="/files/Whispers of the Maestro.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/whispersOfTheMaestro.jpg" alt="Whispers of the Maestro cover"><span>Whispers of the Maestro</span></a>
        <a href="/files/Hermetically Musical.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/hermeticallyMusical.jpg" alt="Hermetically Musical cover"><span>Hermetically Musical</span></a>
        <a href="/files/The Pianist's Chain.pdf" target="_blank"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/thePianistsChain.png" alt="The Pianist's Chain cover"><span>The Pianist's Chain</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="keystone" id="keystoneTexts">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Keystone Texts 2026</p><h2>Keep the PDF. Hold the book.</h2><p>The kind of ideas I could explore with a student in a focused one-hour session, distilled into a text you can return to again and again.</p></div>
      <div class="keystone-actions"><a class="button" href="/files/Keystone Texts 2026.pdf" target="_blank">Read the free PDF</a><p>Hardcopy · $150 AUD</p><a id="askAboutKeystone" href="#contactForm">Ask about a copy</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="parkMap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Public workshops</p><h2>Choose a question, not a level</h2><p>Small gatherings for up to nine people. Each attraction begins with a knot and ends with a clearer path.</p>
      <div class="map-grid">
        <a href="#contactForm" data-attraction="The Practice Foundry"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/buildings.jpg" alt="Colourful buildings under construction"><span><em>In development</em><strong>The Practice Foundry</strong>Make practice feel possible again.</span></a>
        <a href="#contactForm" data-attraction="The Listening Observatory"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/buildings.jpg" alt="Colourful buildings under construction"><span><em>In development</em><strong>The Listening Observatory</strong>Notice what music is really doing.</span></a>
        <a href="#contactForm" data-attraction="The Pianist's Chain"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/buildings.jpg" alt="Colourful buildings under construction"><span><em>In development</em><strong>The Pianist's Chain</strong>Find the missing link in performance.</span></a>
        <a href="#contactForm" data-attraction="The Pattern Arcade"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/buildings.jpg" alt="Colourful buildings under construction"><span><em>In development</em><strong>The Pattern Arcade</strong>Explore the play inside music and mathematics.</span></a>
      </div><p class="art-credit">These attractions are being built now.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section listen-section"><p class="eyebrow">Listen and work together</p><h2>A performance, or a second pair of ears</h2><div class="listen-grid"><a href="https://youtu.be/zhUdsJw0IBo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Hyde Sonata, first movement</strong><span>Watch on YouTube</span></a><a href="http://www.fiverr.com/s/KeNGDl8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Focused piano feedback</strong><span>Visit the Fiverr service</span></a></div></section>

    <section class="about-contact" id="contactForm">
      <div class="about"><figure class="curator-mirror"><img src="/images/hanford-piano-teacher.webp" alt="Hanford Lam at the piano" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy"></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">About Hanford</p><h2>The curator behind the park</h2><p>I am a pianist and teacher interested in the moment confusion becomes curiosity. My studio work brings together music, careful listening and practical ways forward.</p></div></div>
      <form id="contact-form" method="post" action="/sendEmail" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <input type="hidden" name="recaptchaTokenInput" id="recaptchaTokenInput" value="">
        <p class="eyebrow">Begin a conversation</p><h2>What feels tangled?</h2>
        <% if (status == 'fail') { %><p class="form-status error">Sorry, the message could not be sent. Please try again.</p><% } %>
        <% if (status == 'success') { %><p class="form-status success">Your message has been sent. Thank you.</p><% } %>
        <div id="contactEmailDiv"><div id="contactEmailPrepend"><label id="contactEmailText" for="contactEmailInput">Your email</label></div><input id="contactEmailInput" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></div>
        <div id="contactMessageDiv"><label for="contactMessageInput">Your message</label><textarea id="contactMessageInput" name="message" rows="5"></textarea></div>
        <button class="button" id="contactFormSubmit" type="submit">Send this message</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><p>© <span id="year"></span> Hanford Lam</p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/hanfordlamstudio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a></footer>
  <script src="/home-brief.js?v=2" defer></script><script src="/workshop-interest.js" defer></script><script src="/main-bundled.js" defer></script><script src="/pwa.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
